<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n20803" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">hispĭdus</span></b> , a, um,
			adj., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>rough</i>, <i>shaggy</i>, <i>hairy</i>, <i>bristly</i>, <i>prickly.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b> (<b>poet.</b> and in
			post-Aug. prose; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">syn. v. hirtus): facies,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Hor.
					C. 4, 10, 5</span></i>
			; cf. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">frons,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					A. 10, 210</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">membra,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Juv. 2,
					11</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">corpus Nereïdum squamis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin. 9,
					5, 4, § 9</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">mater (of a shegoat with young),</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Mart. 3, 58, 37</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">herba,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					22, 6, 7, § 17</span></i>
			: agri, i. e. <i>dirty</i>, <i>foul
				with rain</i>, = squalidi, <i><span class="en">Hor. C. 2,
				9, 2</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Eurus procellis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Val.
					Fl. 1, 612</span></i>
			.—<b>Poet.</b>, per hypallagen: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sic hispida turpes Proelia villosis ineunt
					complexibus ursi,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Stat.
					Th. 6, 868</span></i>
			.—* </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">agrestis auris ac hispida,</span>”
				i. e. <i>rude</i>, <i>insensible</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Gell. 10, 3, 15</span></i>
			.</div>
